NOTE ON CONTENT — the exam content in this repository (the questions in
assets/js/data/questions.js, the flashcards in assets/js/data/cards.js, and the
study summaries in assets/js/data/study.js) is DERIVED FROM OFFICIAL PUBLICATIONS
of the Israeli Civil Aviation Authority (רת"א): the Aviation Regulations
(Operation of a Small UAS System), 5784-2024; the Aeronautical Information
Publication (פמ"ת) Chapter B-09; the Aviation Law, 5771-2011; and the CAAI
official theory material. The rights in that underlying regulatory material are
not owned by the author of this repository. The MIT license above applies to the
CODE only, not to the underlying regulatory material.
